---
import PageLayout from "@/layouts/PageLayout.astro";
---

<PageLayout>
  <section class="introduction" aria-labelledby="name-heading">
    <h1 id="name-heading" class="page-heading">Guillaume Beardsell</h1>
    <!--<p class="profession">Computational physicist and hands-on R&D leader</p>-->
    <p>
      My work spans computational modeling, engineering design, and leading
      collaborative R&D programs. I have more than a decade of experience across
      academic research and industrial development, combining simulation and
      experiments to understand physical systems and guide engineering
      decisions.
    </p>
    <p>
      I earned my PhD in mechanical engineering at Caltech and previously served
      as Chief Science Officer at Noble Thermodynamic Systems, where I worked on
      power generation and carbon capture.
    </p>
    <p>
      My interests center on applied R&D supported by computational modeling.
      More recently, I've been exploring how AI and machine learning can improve
      models of physical systems and, in turn, guide engineering design and
      accelerate the development of new technologies. I write about some of my
      personal projects in <a class="text-link" href="/writing/">Writing</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      If you live in the San Francisco Bay Area, checkout my hobby project that
      forecasts same-day cloud cover: https://fogcast.today/
    </p>
  </section>
</PageLayout>

<style>
  .introduction {
    max-width: 42rem;
  }
  .introduction .page-heading {
    margin-bottom: 0.7rem;
  }
  .profession {
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .introduction p:not(.profession) {
    margin-bottom: 1.1rem;
  }
  .content-placeholder {
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
</style>
